      "case": "Synthetic: two offers on one page with a shared application paragraph; offer B explicitly involves no programming",
      "pages": [
        "# Chair of Example Studies: open project studies (winter term 2026/27)\n\n## A. Simulating heat flow in battery packs\n\nYou will extend our Python simulation of heat flow in battery packs and validate it against lab measurements. You will write and test simulation code throughout the project.\n\nRequirements: solid Python skills. Experience with numerical methods is a plus.\nDeliverable: a validated simulation module and a short report.\nContact: anna.beispiel@tum.de\n\n## B. Interview study on repair habits of e-bike owners\n\nYou will plan and run 15 semi-structured interviews with e-bike owners and analyse them qualitatively. This project involves no programming.\n\nRequirements: interest in qualitative research; very good German.\nDeliverable: an interview report with recommendations.\nContact: ben.muster@tum.de\n\n## How to apply\n\nBoth project studies start in October 2026. Send your CV and transcript of records to the contact of the project you choose."
      ],
